    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so heavy when you put it like that. like... if everything is just noise, then staying here is just making more noise for no reason. it's exhausting to keep trying to find meaning when you already know it's not there. do you really think there's any actual difference between existing and just... not?",
